        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - A substantial but repeatable reputation and coin grind.\n\n1. Visit the Celestial Court on the Timeless Isle. You can take Emperor Shaohao's offered introductory quests, but the mount itself is a reputation-and-coin purchase; no complete island campaign is required before starting the repeatable reputation farm.\n\n2. Kill reputation-awarding Ordon yaungol at Firewalker Ruins and along the Blazing Way. Loot them for coins. Ordinary island wildlife and frogs can supply coins but do not replace the Ordon reputation grind.\n\n3. Rotate Firewalker Ruins and the Blazing Way while enemies respawn. An optional Scroll of Challenge from Mistweaver Ku summons Archiereus and additional enemies at the Challenge Stone on Three-Breeze Terrace; spending coins on scrolls reduces your saved mount currency.\n\n4. Reach Exalted with Emperor Shaohao and retain 100,000 Timeless Coins on the purchaser. If coins are short, continue looting island enemies, treasures and available coin quests. Ordon Sanctuary's old cloak-access restriction is not necessary for the lower-area route.\n\n5. Buy Reins of the Heavenly Golden Cloud Serpent from Mistweaver Ku at the Celestial Court (42.6,54.6), then use them. Mistweaver Xia is a different vendor and appears for Timewalking.",
