        mountCategory = "Other",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Buying is immediate; a single engineer needs thirty daily cooldowns to craft it.\n\n1. Compare a finished Sky Golem on the Auction House with the cost and month-long preparation of self-crafting. A buyer needs no Engineering skill.\n\n2. To craft, train Pandaria Engineering with Sally Fizzlefury at 16.0,83.0 in the Valley of the Four Winds and raise it to 75. Kill Pandaria creatures until Chief Engineer Jard's Journal (100910) drops; use it to learn the Sky Golem and energy-source recipes.\n\n3. Craft one Jard's Peculiar Energy Source each daily reset using ten Ghost Iron Bars. Keep all thirty on the SAME engineer: they are soulbound, and other engineers cannot pool their daily crafts for your mount.\n\n4. Buy or make thirty Living Steel. The Alchemy transmute is a separate preparation route; purchasing Living Steel does not remove the Jard's daily cooldown.\n\n5. When the engineer has thirty energy sources and thirty Living Steel, craft Sky Golem and use the finished item. Save extra daily energy sources only if you intend another craft.",
