        mountCategory = "Dungeon and Raids",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A random weekly Mythic drop; the account raid skip makes repeat visits much shorter.\n\n1. Set raid difficulty to MYTHIC, then enter Siege of Orgrimmar under the Vale's Mogu'shan Palace area (74.0,42.0). If the entrance phase is confusing, use Zidormi near the Seat of Knowledge to return to the earlier Vale.\n\n2. If your account has defeated Garrosh before, interact with the Scroll of Past Deeds beside Lorewalker Cho just inside the entrance. Use its Garrosh skip. This is an account unlock; it does not need a separate quest on every alt.\n\n3. Without the skip, clear the raid once through Garrosh. At Galakras, protect the demolition crew, clear the tower and use the cannon to bring the boss down. Continue through Spoils, Thok, Siegecrafter and the Paragons to the Inner Sanctum.\n\n4. Kill Garrosh on Mythic and check his loot for Kor'kron Juggernaut. Bonus rolls cannot award this mount; Normal and Heroic do not drop it.\n\n5. Use the mount if awarded. Otherwise repeat on another eligible character or after the weekly reset. Kor'kron War Wolf was the retired Ahead of the Curve reward and is not this drop.",
