        mountCategory = "PvP",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Accumulate 500 eligible PvP coin awards, then make the vendor purchase.\n\n1. Visit Speaker Gulan on the Timeless Isle's eastern cliff (74.9,44.9). Read the current Censer of Eternal Agony and Fire-Watcher's Oath tooltips and buy the appropriate coin-earning item with Timeless Coins.\n\n2. For the island route, activate the Censer when safe and use its hostile-to-players state to fight eligible players on the Timeless Isle. Its activation consumes health; heal before fighting. Watch for the victim's recently-sacrificed debuff, which prevents another immediate Censer coin award.\n\n3. For the Oath alternative, keep Fire-Watcher's Oath active during eligible PvP and obtain the required killing blows. The Oath and Censer have different restrictions; refresh the buff when it expires and check that your currency actually increases.\n\n4. Save 500 Bloody Coins. Do not spend the mount's budget on the Vengeful Porcupette or other rewards first.\n\n5. Return to Speaker Gulan, buy Reins of the Ashhide Mushan Beast for 500 Bloody Coins and use them. The retired Brawler's Burly Mushan Beast is a separate appearance.",
    },
