        mountCategory = "Rare Drops",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A contested aerial spawn and random drop can require many attempts.\n\n1. Travel to the Timeless Isle east of the Jade Forest. Climb toward the eastern bridge and watch the sky around 65.6,57.4, where Huolon starts his flight route.\n\n2. Wait for the black cloud serpent, then follow his route if he is already flying. Keep a ranged instant attack ready and land a valid tag before another player kills him.\n\n3. Kill and loot Huolon. Every eligible kill can drop Reins of the Thundering Onyx Cloud Serpent; there is no daily or weekly mount-loot lockout.\n\n4. If the mount is absent, remain for another spawn or return later. Respawns commonly take tens of minutes and competition matters; no fixed timer or forced shard-reset trick is guaranteed.\n\n5. Use the reins when they drop. Farming nearby Ordon enemies while waiting can also advance Emperor Shaohao reputation, but those enemies do not drop Huolon's mount.",
